      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4247,
        "name": "双果清露",
        "desc": "<p>拥有双重果味的饮品。先在底部铺上满满的果粒，再倒入融合了茶底和果汁的冰沙，果香清新且富有层次感，没有人能拒绝这样一杯饮品。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/2428ec3620771f34d7d4e50355387f2b_3559438253796119671.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4248,
        "name": "奇怪的双果清露",
        "desc": "<p>拥有双重果味的饮品。杯底的果肉不知为何带有一丝苦涩，使得心情也变得糟糕了起来…为了平复情绪，要不再做一杯试试看吧？</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/8fba38a79483eb03354e6a9da8a0fb35_1358753871188704735.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4246,
        "name": "美味的双果清露",
        "desc": "<p>拥有双重果味的饮品。喝上一口，果香缭绕在唇齿，一时间，宛如坐在白色的沙滩上，看橙红的朝阳缓缓升起，心情也不由得为之一振。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/66d2ae5855b182acc30945d3c1eaba5a_624938700360235303.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "枫丹肥肝"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4223,
        "name": "食谱：枫丹肥肝",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「枫丹肥肝」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_6457566979194668786.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1284,
        "name": "禽肉",
        "desc": "禽类的新鲜肉块。经过适当处理可以制成让人精神一振的佳肴。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Fowl_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4006,
        "name": "茉洁草",
        "desc": "<p>华润而温莹的桃色花朵。拥有不同层次的芬芳，是用来调香的主要原料之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/946e456e7b8f19211bdb36ab65ab0a23_9206363963951935211.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4163,
        "name": "枫丹肥肝",
        "desc": "<p>枫丹的传统菜肴。将肥肝简单煎熟后，就能摆盘上菜。表面焦黄，里内绵软，此般美味皆来源于对火候的精准把控。因此制作时需全神贯注，否则一不留神肥肝就可能变成一锅油了。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/02eb1ac4f39b8548762bc66d65183cc7_3548967658132992975.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4162,
        "name": "奇怪的枫丹肥肝",
        "desc": "<p>枫丹的传统菜肴。第一口下去，仿佛吃了一勺油；不死心又尝了第二口，却腻得难以下咽…难、难道是因为煎制的时候油倒多了？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/fccd40c0a423de9b8808a2505bc5da99_3002159409827917861.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4161,
        "name": "美味的枫丹肥肝",
        "desc": "<p>枫丹的传统菜肴。柔软细腻的肥肝，宛若一条丝滑的缎带，在舌尖的轻轻触碰之下，滑入喉头。如此丰润至极的美味，恐怕是一吃误终身，不吃终身误。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/659486bc43f59dc7d56dc69f1646d699_6683811313057035761.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "花果三重奏"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4217,
        "name": "食谱：花果三重奏",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「花果三重奏」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_6702683364402313959.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4006,
        "name": "茉洁草",
        "desc": "<p>华润而温莹的桃色花朵。拥有不同层次的芬芳，是用来调香的主要原料之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/946e456e7b8f19211bdb36ab65ab0a23_9206363963951935211.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4098,
        "name": "泡泡桔",
        "desc": "<p><span>生长在温暖、湿润、光照充足之处的果实，圆圆的外表下，偷偷藏着甜甜的甘鲜。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/6cf3c48d4c41e5ac44723725064d3f85_6662973587425858896.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1898,
        "name": "鸟蛋",
        "desc": "拥有无限可能性的禽类的卵，能带来一整天所需的蛋白质。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Bird Egg_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4157,
        "name": "花果三重奏",
        "desc": "<p>散发着浪漫气息的甜点。先备好挞皮，往挞底挤上果酱和泡泡桔制作的凝乳，盖上一层饼皮，再裱好蛋白霜，进炉烘烤。一次性可以享受到三重花果香气，是餐后甜品的优秀备选。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/9ded4f98b5ce67e2f177250249738240_5301932882196631530.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4156,
        "name": "奇怪的花果三重奏",
        "desc": "<p>散发着浪漫气息的甜点。在烤糊多次蛋白霜之后，好不容易做出了还算是不错的外形。但由于花费的时间过多，泡泡桔片已经哭丧起了脸，变得不再香甜。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/5ca0e58df7f6cb888538ddcc9f49a767_5163646351668053814.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4155,
        "name": "美味的花果三重奏",
        "desc": "<p>散发着浪漫气息的甜点。酥松香浓的挞皮和清爽可口的果馅一并融化在口中，最为令人赞叹的是焦黄与莹白均匀交织的蛋白霜，仿佛是被太阳烘烤过的云霞一般，带着味蕾一并升空，留下满口惊艳。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/1a69782042748a1fc6c9ca4f32f1a228_1253860322376861339.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "果果软糖"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4209,
        "name": "食谱：果果软糖",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「果果软糖」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_5547266327131391732.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4098,
        "name": "泡泡桔",
        "desc": "<p><span>生长在温暖、湿润、光照充足之处的果实，圆圆的外表下，偷偷藏着甜甜的甘鲜。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/6cf3c48d4c41e5ac44723725064d3f85_6662973587425858896.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1328,
        "name": "糖",
        "desc": "提炼自甜甜花的调味剂。它的甜味仿佛有着与人共鸣的力量，能够驱散内心的阴霾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sugar_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4202,
        "name": "果果软糖",
        "desc": "<p>质地柔软的糖果。早先是一种存储水果的方式，经过长时间的发展，已经成为了枫丹人的童年回忆。入口甜丝丝的，颇有嚼劲，吃再多也不会腻。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/83b9a3708d08d45437952b1dd51e6bb5_7881826270347699707.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4203,
        "name": "奇怪的果果软糖",
        "desc": "<p>质地柔软的糖果。黏糊糊的糖果粘在牙齿上，给咀嚼带来了不少阻力。清理牙齿倒是简单，只是想要享受甜蜜一刻的心情已经再也无法找回。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/96dc5205a8a1032506d247b00fbec228_4234605233370704368.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4204,
        "name": "美味的果果软糖",
        "desc": "<p>质地柔软的糖果。咬上一口，满满的果香，仿佛一整个五彩斑斓的果园都被浓缩到了小小一颗糖果里。一不小心糖罐就见底了，就连粘在手上的糖霜都不想放过！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/ccf7bb6197c09c1ef25b44ef71e5c7d6_9079921120661358283.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4125,
        "name": "方块戏法",
        "desc": "<p>林尼的特色料理。他用绒布盖住了你刚刚采摘下来的果子，掀开绒布，斑斓多彩的软糖瞬间映入眼帘。吃了一颗，心情突然发生了某种变化。这难道又是大魔术师趁人不注意，偷偷施加了不可思议的俘获人心魔法？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/5048808898d4e1a3ad75d70ec6723921_1180498261544336426.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "桔桔薄饼"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4430,
        "name": "食谱：桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「桔桔薄饼」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_3219457022336375967.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4098,
        "name": "泡泡桔",
        "desc": "<p><span>生长在温暖、湿润、光照充足之处的果实，圆圆的外表下，偷偷藏着甜甜的甘鲜。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/6cf3c48d4c41e5ac44723725064d3f85_6662973587425858896.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1737,
        "name": "面粉",
        "desc": "由小麦磨成的粉末。无论做成怎样的主食，都能给食客的胃带来片刻充实。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Flour_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4449,
        "name": "奇怪的桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。第一口寡淡得令人担心自己是否失去了味觉，第二口又被甜味齁得宁可味觉立刻消失…如此刺激的体验，宛如在惊涛骇浪中驾驶浪船一般，就算上岸了还是心有余悸。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/26b98bec5dc2bf21e89e1cf77b14786a_7919030368085251775.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4450,
        "name": "桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。先煎好饼皮，再加入果酱、奶油和水果切片。其实做法并不单一，根据加入的食材不同，口味也是五花八门。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/d3b0a404f19a59face44f94586b27a80_8127824273642722259.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4451,
        "name": "美味的桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。轻盈的奶油与绵密的果酱交织成悠悠乐声，软乎乎的饼皮，仿佛是翩翩荡于其中的裙裾，引得舌尖也忍不住随之起舞。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/6412c3609eeb6c916dd5788d06fd3b37_6930054844467954601.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "千灵慕斯"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4827,
        "name": "食谱：千灵慕斯",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「千灵慕斯」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/06/157749474/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_8454692786656113519.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1898,
        "name": "鸟蛋",
        "desc": "拥有无限可能性的禽类的卵，能带来一整天所需的蛋白质。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Bird Egg_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1328,
        "name": "糖",
        "desc": "提炼自甜甜花的调味剂。它的甜味仿佛有着与人共鸣的力量，能够驱散内心的阴霾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sugar_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4822,
        "name": "奇怪的千灵慕斯",
        "desc": "<p>蓝盈盈的千灵节甜点。外形看起来有点不妙，让人联想到了冰霜骗骗花，难道参照时选的湖光铃兰是骗骗花变的？在千灵节端出这样一份甜点，说不定会被审判…还是悄悄解决掉吧！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/06/157749474/1f76e61e14cc9b12d59d43fcea33562f_4163693779211951921.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4823,
        "name": "千灵慕斯",
        "desc": "<p>蓝盈盈的千灵节甜点。参照湖光铃兰的花苞造型，制作出的慕斯。在千灵节习俗被改为讨要甜点之后，摇身一变，成了最受欢迎的枫丹节日美食。听到「不给糖就审判」后，别忘记把它分享给大家哦！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/06/157749474/4cd8fdaff7a2e8b5cc460c3fe503d90a_5871963388451536992.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4824,
        "name": "美味的千灵慕斯",
        "desc": "<p>蓝盈盈的千灵节甜点。色泽晶莹，好比是水面泛出的波光；外形淡雅，如同刚从枝头撷下的花卉；口感轻盈，仿佛雪花融于喉头。能吃到这样一份美味，应该是千灵节里最幸福的事情了吧！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/06/157749474/b9b41726668159a6d9c155d86392227d_1050212639718050295.png",
